- Persistence-time Bean Validation constraints on the entity (checked by Hibernate Validator on flush): `Owner.address` `@NotEmpty` (40), `Owner.city` `@NotEmpty` (44), `Owner.telephone` `@NotEmpty` + `@Pattern(regexp = "^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$", ...)` (48-49), `Owner.email` `@Email` (53); inherited from `Person`: `firstName` `@NotEmpty`, `lastName` `@NotEmpty` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Person.java` lines 31-37).
- Many derived/computed transient getters (`getRegion`, `getIdentityKey`, `getAgeBand`, `getMembershipPoints`, `getMembershipLevel`, `getCustomerCode`/`getCheckDigit`, `getTelephoneDisplay`, etc.) are used by the controller and the response mapper.

**Mapper** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (MapStruct):
- `Owner toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` (lines 30-32): `@Mapping(target = "id", ignore = true)`, `@Mapping(target = "pets", ignore = true)`.
