## 6. Side effects, events, defaults, derived values (in execution order within `addOwner`)

No events published, no emails, no async. The side effects are all local mutation, one persistence call (with cascade), and one audit log:

1. `normalizeAddress(...)` (122) — trims, collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands ST/RD/AVE (helper lines 378-402).
2. Required-field guard → `MissingOwnerFieldsException` if any of firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone blank (124-141).
3. `normalizeTelephone(...)` (142) — converts to E.164, else `InvalidTelephoneException` (helper 457-491).
4. `sharesHousehold` read (143); it is a create-time hint only, never persisted.
5. `ownerMapper.toOwner(...)` (145) — maps DTO→entity; `setEmail` lower-cases email.
6. `owner.setAddress(address)` / `owner.setTelephone(telephone)` (146-147) — store normalized values.
7. `validateEmailDomain(...)` (148) — blocklist mailinator/tempmail/guerrillamail → `DisposableEmailDomainException` (helper 312-324).
8. `validatePostcode(...)` (149) — range-check by region → `InvalidPostcodeException` (helper 346-364).
9. `owner.setHouseholdId(householdIdFor(lastName, postcode))` (153) — deterministic SHA-256-derived household id (helper 691-705).
10. Household-duplicate guard (157-159): if not `sharesHousehold` and household already in use → `DuplicateIdentityException`.
11. Identity-key duplicate guard (162-164) → `DuplicateIdentityException`.
12. City-capacity guard (165-167): ≥50 owners in city → `CityAtCapacityException`.
13. Future-date guard (168-170): registrationDate after today → `FutureRegistrationDateException`.
14. Compute `effectiveDate` (default today) then `toBusinessDay(...)` (171-173) — rolls weekend to Monday (helper 621-630).
15. Daily-limit guard (174-176): ≥100 registered that day → `DailyRegistrationLimitException`.
16. `owner.setRegistrationDate(registrationDate)` (177) — default/adjusted value stored.
17. `owner.setCustomerCode(customerCodeFor(owner))` (178) — `<REGION>-<HASH8>` (helpers 415-443).
18. `owner.setNamesakeCount(...)` (179) — count of existing same first+last name (helper 543-550).
19. `owner.setHouseholdSize(...)` (180) — household member count after this create (helper 563-571).
20. `owner.setPossibleDuplicate(...)` / `owner.setPossibleDuplicateOf(...)` (183-185) — soft-duplicate flagging (helper 518-531), skipped when `sharesHousehold`.
21. **Persist**: `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` (186) → `ownerRepository.save` (cascades to `pets`, DB assigns id).
22. **Audit log** (187-188): `AUDIT.info("owner created id=... customerCode=... registrationDate=... membershipLevel=...")` to the `"AUDIT"` logger (declared line 69).
23. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)` (189) then `ownerDto.setBulkSignupWarning(isBulkSignupWarning())` (190) — response enrichment.
24. `Location` header set to `/api/owners/{id}` (191-192); returns **201 CREATED** (193).

